# Macabre Waltz (CR 601.2c, 115.1): "up to two target creature cards" is no more than two. Three Entombs bury Memnite, Ornithopter
# and Llanowar Elves: naming all three is refused, and choosing just the Memnite returns that one and leaves the other two in
# the graveyard. The Memnite is then the only card in hand, so the discard takes it: eight cards in the graveyard (Black Lotus,
# three Entombs, the three creature cards and the Waltz).

